<p>{{ FullName|raw }},</p>

<p>An account for {{ AppTitle|raw }} has been created for you with the following details:<br/>
Email: {{ EmailAddress|raw }}<br/>
Name: {{ FullName|raw }}<br/>
Phone: {{ Phone|raw }}<br/>
Organization: {{ Organization|raw }}<br/>
Position: {{ Position|raw }}<br/>
Password: {{ Password }}</p>
{% if CreatedBy is defined and CreatedBy %}
    Created by: {{ CreatedBy|raw }}
{% endif %}

<a href="{{ ScriptUrl|raw }}">Log In to {{ AppTitle|raw }}</a>
